(Small South Indian packaged food manufacturers face critical operational issues: ingredient price volatility, frying/sealing process scrap, lack of) Tj
T* (batch-level yield visibility, stock leakage, state-specific GST calculation errors, and untracked customer receivables. This Order-to-Audit) Tj
T* (Management System delivers a full-stack, closed-loop database application connecting procurement, production, inventory, sales, billing, and) Tj
T* (statutory audit. The system enforces strict business rules: dispatch is blocked when finished stock is insufficient, batch yields exceeding ±3%) Tj
T* (are automatically flagged, stock movements are double-entry verified, and customers with active balances cannot be deactivated.) Tj
