(Inventory balances are never directly overwritten. Every inventory change is recorded as an immutable debit/credit movement in StockLedger. Inflows) Tj
T* (\(+1\): PURCHASE_RECEIPT and PRODUCTION_YIELD. Outflows \(-1\): PRODUCTION_ISSUE, DAMAGE_SCRAP, and SALES_DISPATCH. Each) Tj
T* (movement links to sourceDocumentType, sourceDocumentId, balanceBefore, balanceAfter, unit valuation, and userId. Raw materials use dynamic) Tj
T* (Weighted Average Costing \(WAC\): New WAC = \(OldStock * OldRate + PurchaseQty * PurchaseRate\) / \(OldStock + PurchaseQty\). On flour purchase) Tj
